<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Model Architecture and Training Details</h3>

<section id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Model Architecture</h5>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We build on OpenVLA-7B <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib22" title="" class="ltx_ref">Kim et al. (2024)</a></cite> as the base model, integrating <span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">MAR</span>, a lightweight, memory-based meta-learning module. In <span id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">MAR</span>, global prior representations are encoded via self-attention, while cross-attention <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib45" title="" class="ltx_ref">Vaswani et al. (2023)</a></cite> fuses target and context to produce a final hybrid latent representation. Each attention block is followed by Layer Normalization and a final MLP projection.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Training Settings</h5>

<div id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We trained all MetaVLA variants with LoRA <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib15" title="" class="ltx_ref">Hu et al. (2021)</a></cite> on 8 A100-80 GB GPUs with 75K training steps, taking approximately 24 GPU hours, using 8 x 80GB VRAM. Training hyperparameters are in Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Training Settings ‣ A.3 Model Architecture and Training Details ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ MetaVLA: Unified Meta Co-Training for Efficient Embodied Adaptation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T4" class="ltx_table">
<div id="A1.T4.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:258.4pt;height:161.7pt;vertical-align:-77.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(33.0pt,-20.7pt) scale(1.34320821337096,1.34320821337096) ;">
<table id="A1.T4.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A1.T4.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r" style="padding-bottom: 3.0pt;"><span id="A1.T4.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_align_center">Hyperparameter</span></th>
<th id="A1.T4.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column" style="padding-bottom: 3.0pt;"><span id="A1.T4.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Value</span></th></tr>
</thead>
